{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o053a","title":"曹丕广陵观兵遇水道冰封引还","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o053a-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"曹丕广陵观兵遇水道冰封引还","evidence":["wendi-e-o053a-q"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-55cd073010fc886f3114","label":"正文","text":"六年秋帝欲征吴，群臣大议","evidence":["cuimao-q-c2e26de37930d2990a0c"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-b2350008bc7bb6648758","label":"正文","text":"鲍勋面谏不可劳兵袭远，帝益忿，左迁为治书执法","evidence":["cuimao-q-b941b87fdf57863099ef"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"观兵撤军","evidence":["wendi-e-o053a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0073","role":"面谏而被左迁者","evidence":["cuimao-q-b941b87fdf57863099ef"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":225,"label":"黄初六年十月及是岁","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y225","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o049","basis":"黄初六年十月及是岁"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o053a-q","wendi-q-o049","wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o053a-q","source_order":[2,466,"O053a"],"order":668}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0073","name":"鲍勋","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-b941b87fdf57863099ef","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-6c7fb7b8213da071aaf6","layer":"original","quote":"勋面谏曰：“王师屡征而未有所克者，盖以吴、蜀唇齿相依，凭阻山水，有难拔之势故也。往年龙舟飘荡〖14〗，隔在南岸；圣躬蹈危，臣下破胆。此时宗庙几至倾覆，为百世之戒。今又劳兵袭远，日费千金；中国虚耗，令黠虏玩威〖15〗。臣窃以为不可。”帝益忿之，左迁勋为治书执法","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":302,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-c2e26de37930d2990a0c","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-6c7fb7b8213da071aaf6","layer":"original","quote":"六年秋〖13〗，帝欲征吴，群臣大议","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":302,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o053a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1d30ef656dda0ab13df8","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，行幸广陵故城〖15〗，临江观兵〖16〗。戎卒十余万，旌旗数百里。﹝二﹞是岁，大寒，水道冰，舟不得入江；乃引还。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":465,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：黄初六年（公元 225）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":467,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-61512c4ade75d71d6a76","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o049","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-d5847039c2d504d36e8e","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，遣使者循行许昌以东，尽沛郡〖2〗。问民所疾苦，贫者赈贷之。﹝一﹞三月，行幸召陵〖3〗，通讨虏渠〖4〗。乙巳〖5〗，还许昌宫。并州刺史梁习讨鲜卑轲比能〖6〗，大破之。辛未〖7〗，帝为舟师，东征。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
